\f4\fs26 Shakti didn\'92t care too much for interrogation techniques, it seem all so aggressive and manipulative. \'93If only they would just tell the truth, it would really make thing a whole lot easier.\'94 He had often said, quite stupidly, out loud. When the acclaimed Detective Superintendent Lanning volunteered to take the lead on the interview, he snapped up the chance. To prepare she needed an hour or so to review the file and Shakti took the chance to call his mother.\
\'93Alex, what do you want?\'94 His mother was in the middle of entertaining important people and had no time to indulge her child.\
\'93Mother, I don\'92t have much time. I have just arrested a serial killer and I am about to interview him.\'94\
\'93Oh, simply ghastly. Please cease reminding me that you are a public servant. What do you want? Your father and I have guests.\'94\
\'93Can you add another to the list?\'94 Shakti \
\'93Yes, dear.\'94\
\'93Sarah Jacobson, PhD, L.5.\'94\
\'93I hope she\'92s better than the rest. At least she is level 5.\'94\
\'93Thank you, mother.\'94\
\'93Go back to your sordid criminals.\'94 She disconnected quickly. She had guests to attend to.
